      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Yeh chapter basic (bunyadi) computational structures, yaani lists, stacks, queues, trees aur graphs, ka poora overview (jaiza) deta hai. Is mein in ki properties, operations aur istemal bataye gaye, aur yeh bataya gaya ke data ko organize karne aur sambhalne mein in ka kya role (kaam) hai. Chapter yeh bhi batata hai ke masle ki zaroorat ke mutabiq sahi data structure kaise chunein, aur complex (pecheeda) problems hal karne ke liye alag alag structures ko kaise milayein. Maqsad yeh hai ke parhne wala in structures ko computing ke alag alag kaamon mein achhi tarah istemal kar sake."
          },
